4
00:00:02,345 --> 00:00:03,730
33 milisaniyeden

5
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:05,059
az vakti var.

6
00:00:05,306 --> 00:00:06,807
Saniyede 30 kare,

7
00:00:06,827 --> 00:00:07,933
